  "description": "Plain Newtonsoft.Json POCO models for the Shopify Admin REST API (customers, orders, products, fulfillments, inventory, refunds, transactions, webhooks and more), derived from ShopifySharp's REST entities. Plus a transport-neutral Admin GraphQL client (HttpClient based) with error parsing, cost-bucket throttling, safe retries (unkeyed mutations are never resent after an unknown outcome), cursor paging and @idempotent keys. Also bulk operations (staged JSONL upload, polling with backoff, streamed results), webhook HMAC verification with an idempotent subscription registrar, typed builders for common non-money catalog operations, and System.Text.Json response models.",
